[0.129.3]
* Fix SigNoz crash on Cloudron: run server from writable `/app/data/signoz` (Prometheus `queries.active` mmap).

[0.129.2]
* Fix ZooKeeper on Cloudron: patch Bitnami env defaults that reset paths to read-only `/bitnami`, and set `ZOOCFGDIR` so `zkServer.sh` reads config from `/run`.

[0.129.1]
* Fix startup on Cloudron read-only filesystem: ClickHouse logs/data and ZooKeeper config under `/app/data` and `/run`.

[0.129.0.1]
* Fix startup on Cloudron read-only filesystem: ClickHouse logs/data and ZooKeeper config under `/app/data` and `/run`.

[0.129.0]
* Initial public packaging for Cloudron: unified SigNoz v0.129.0 stack (ZooKeeper, ClickHouse, SigNoz, OTel collector v0.144.5).
* Addons: localstorage, postgresql (metadata), sendmail (alert SMTP).
* OTLP TCP ports 4317/4318; health check `GET /api/v1/health`.
* Automated upstream watch and catalog publishing via GitHub Actions.
